{"type":"item.completed","item":{"id":"item_4","type":"command_execution","command":"/opt/homebrew/bin/zsh -lc \"wc -l docs/research/2026-11-20-production-readiness/council-q/library-pack.md docs/prd/10-filing-phase.md AGENTS.md; rg -n '\"'^#'\"' docs/research/2026-11-20-production-readiness/council-q/library-pack.md\"","aggregated_output":"    1357 docs/research/2026-11-20-production-readiness/council-q/library-pack.md\n     201 docs/prd/10-filing-phase.md\n     492 AGENTS.md\n    2050 total\n1:# The served library as of 2026-09-20 (43 questions, 82 days)\n3:## The list\n48:## v1: How much credit support will NVIDIA have committed under its AI-cloud model by the publication of its FY2027 annual report?\n88:## v2: At NVIDIA's FY2027 annual report, how much will its commitments for customer and cloud-provider credit support, guarantees, and capacity backstops reach?\n133:## v3: Will NVIDIA sign a financial guarantee for OpenAI's Ohio data-center lease by 2027-07-01?\n161:## v4: Will NVIDIA begin shipping Vera Rubin by 2026-12-31?\n188:## v5: How much will the four largest AI hyperscalers spend on data-center capital expenditures in calendar 2026?\n229:## v6: How much will the four largest AI hyperscalers spend on data-center capital expenditures in calendar 2027?\n261:## v7: Will NVIDIA launch its Kyber rack-scale architecture by 2027-12-31?\n296:## v8: How much revenue will NVIDIA generate from stand-alone CPU sales in FY2027?\n332:## v9: How much Data Center segment revenue will NVIDIA report for FY2027?\n374:## v10: Will China's authorities authorize Chinese AI companies to purchase Nvidia H200 chips by 2027-01-31?\n420:## v11: Will NVIDIA complete its proposed investment of about US$500 million in Firmus preference shares by 2026-12-31?\n438:## v12: Will NVIDIA launch its GeForce RTX 60-series GPUs by 2027-12-31?\n462:## v13: Will the French competition authority issue a decision concluding its antitrust investigation into NVIDIA by 2026-12-31?\n478:## v14: How much total revenue will NVIDIA report for FY2027?\n513:## v15: How much will NVIDIA's supply commitments reach at the publication of its FY2027 annual report?\n553:## v16: How much total CPU revenue will NVIDIA generate in FY2027?\n601:## v17: How much will NVIDIA's total revenue grow in FY2028?\n636:## v18: Will NVIDIA bring the Vera CPU to general availability by 2026-12-31?\n664:## v19: Will the U.S. Senate pass the Remote Access Security Act by 2026-12-31?\n688:## v20: Will NVIDIA complete its planned $1 billion investment in NAVER Corp. by 2027-07-24?\n723:## v21: How much will NVIDIA's total revenue grow in FY2027?\n757:## v22: Will NVIDIA sign a financial guarantee for OpenAI's Ohio data-center lease by 2027-07-01?\n787:## v23: Will NVIDIA complete its reported $5 billion investment in Safe Superintelligence by 2027-07-27?\n812:## v24: Will NVIDIA begin shipping RTX Spark systems by 2026-10-31?\n848:## v25: Will Taiwan's Ministry of Economic Affairs introduce performance-threshold export controls for advanced chips by 2027-01-31?\n864:## v26: Will Taiwan introduce a criminal ban on AI chip exports to China by 2027-01-31?\n883:## v27: Will the U.S. Department of Commerce conclude its investigation into Chinese firms' access to advanced U.S. chips by 2027-01-31?\n907:## v28: What gross margin will NVIDIA report for FY2027?\n946:## v29: How much will NVIDIA's equity investment commitments reach at the publication of its FY2027 annual report?\n986:## v30: Will NVIDIA complete its planned $1.5 billion investment in SB Energy by 2027-08-17?\n1014:## v31: Will NVIDIA complete its planned $1.5 billion investment in SB Energy by 2027-08-17?\n1042:## v32: How much will NVIDIA’s committed payment to license Poolside’s AI technology reach at the publication of its FY2027 annual report?\n1063:## v33: What gross margin will NVIDIA report for FY2028?\n1095:## v34: Will NVIDIA sign an agreement to acquire Hugging Face by 2027-02-26?\n1117:## v35: How much total revenue will NVIDIA report for FY2028?\n1155:## v36: How much will NVIDIA's committed investment in MediaTek through convertible bonds reach at the publication of its FY2027 annual report?\n1182:## v37: Will NVIDIA begin production of the Rubin CPX accelerator by 2027-03-31?\n1201:## v38: Will NVIDIA complete an investment of roughly $2.5 billion to $3 billion in Thinking Machines Lab by 2027-09-04?\n1218:## v39: Will the U.S. Justice Department conclude its antitrust review of NVIDIA’s Groq transaction by 2027-01-31?\n1251:## v40: Will NVIDIA invest $10 billion to anchor Anthropic's IPO by 2026-09-20?\n1275:## v41: Will the Federal Reserve raise its policy rate at its September 2026 meeting?\n1292:## v42: Will the AI Energy Management Alliance's first power-flexible AI data center in Manassas secure faster grid interconnection terms or preferential tariffs by 2026-12-31?\n1311:## v43: Will the required U.S. and EU regulatory reviews of NVIDIA's Hugging Face acquisition be cleared by 2027-06-30?\n1331:## Research groups\n","exit_code":0,"status":"completed"}}
